title: 'statement-store: read affinity topics from a file'

doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    The hidden `--statement-affinity-topics-file <PATH>` flag of the substrate node and the
    omni-node reads explicit affinity topics from a file, one 32-byte hex topic per line, with
    blank lines and `#` comments skipped. The topics add to the repeatable
    `--statement-affinity-topic` flag and take effect only on the experimental v2 DHT
    statement path.

crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: major
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: major
- name: staging-node-cli
  bump: minor
- name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
  bump: major
